'''It'll be fine!''' (Japanese: '''It'll be fine!''') is a song and music video made for [[Project Piplup]] featuring [[Dawn's Piplup]]. It was released on the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=__HPQPjSdzw official Japanese YouTube channel] on January 14, 2022. It is a medley of four ''[[Pokémon the Series: Diamond and Pearl]]'' ending theme songs: [[By Your Side ~Hikari's Theme~]], [[Surely Tomorrow]], [[In Your Heart, LaLaLa]], and [[Message of the Wind]], in order of appearance, sung by {{an|Dawn}}'s Japanese voice actress, [[Megumi Toyoguchi]].

