==Trivia==
* The title of this song refers to the Japanese version of {{an|Dawn}}'s catchphrase, "Daijōbu!" (Japanese: 大丈夫), which can be translated as "It'll be fine!" or "Don't worry!", as well as regularly translated as "No need to worry!" in the English dub.

